Bringing about the darkest days of the Spellblaze you hasten the death of your foes.

When you deal damage to a creature in radius [3, 4, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] or less around you and it dips below 33% life you automatically unleash the fury of the Spellblaze.

Affected foes will start taking [32, 39, 45, 50, 54 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage each turn until it dies as long as it remains in radius [3, 4, 5, 6, 6 (TL1-5)] of you.

The damage increases with spellpower.
